    {
      "id": "error-handling",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1126,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 250,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "#EF4444",
      "text": "ERROR HANDLING\n\nDaemon Errors:\n- PTY spawn failure\n- Socket bind failure\n- Session not found\n\nSocket Errors:\n- ECONNREFUSED (no daemon)\n- ENOENT (socket missing)\n- EPIPE (daemon crashed)\n\nRecovery:\n- Auto-reconnect with backoff\n- Spawn daemon if missing\n- UI error state"
    },
